0 // A1-S02 samples this part's real surface for the point swarm and A1-S03
0 // crossfades that swarm onto this exact mesh, so both halves of the
0 // crossfade must come from ONE piece of geometry - a cloud sampled from
0 // one model and a mesh built from another would not converge, and the
0 // shot is entirely about them converging.
0 // Colour 0 (Black) is bound here rather than left as 16 (inherit): this
0 // is a scene, not a sub-part, and it has nothing to inherit from.
0 // Sits on the origin plane. Brick 1x1 (3005.dat) is 24 LDU tall, so its
0 // base is at y = 0 with the part translated to -24 in LDraw's Y-down
0 // frame - the same convention monolith.ldr stacks in.
1 0 0 -24 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 3005.dat
